.TH CSTR_COMPARE 3 "2026-07-10" "c_collections" "C Collections Library - Macros"
.SH NAME
cstr_compare \- compare the string to a C string
.SH LIBRARY
C Collections (libccollections, \-lccollections)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <ccollections/cstring.h>

cstr_compare(s, str);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
This macro is a pass-through wrapper for cstring_compare().
.fi
.SH PARAMETERS
.nf
s     cstr to compare
str   C string to compare against
.fi
.SH RETURN VALUE
.nf
A negative value if s < str, zero if they are equal, a positive value if
s > str
.fi
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR cstring_compare (3),
.BR cstr_equals (3)
